<title>FRANCE: Metz-Nancy-Lorraine Jan-Oct air cargo volume slips.</title>
<headline>Metz-Nancy-Lorraine Jan-Oct air cargo volume slips.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metz-Nancy-Lorraine Airport said it handled 3,040 tonnes of freight and mail traffic in the first ten months of the year, a decline of 2.6 percent on January-October 1996.</p>
<p>The only &quot;all-cargo&quot; service at the airport is a nightly L'Aeropostale round-trip from Mulhouse which stops at Metz and Paris/CDG carrfying mail and express shipments. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
